      {#- The design partner offer: the only design partner box on the site
          (founder, 2026-11-24), at the foot of Pricing and of the home page.
          The home page's Become a design partner button lands on it at
          /pricing/#design-partners. Since
          2026-11-24 (founder) the page keeps the summary: who it is for and
          four lines (the 90-day pilot with no monthly fee, the setup, free
          for the first 5 per src/_data/pilot.js, the day-90 choice of
          today's price locked for two years, and helping shape it), then the
          full program as a PDF and the email to apply. The terms match the
          Design Partner Program doc and the business plan; change them
          together. -#}
      <section class="ent-cta ent-partner" id="design-partners" aria-labelledby="cta-h">
        <p class="ent-badge"><span class="ent-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Design partner pilots open</p>
        <h2 id="cta-h">Build the future of your business.</h2>
        <p class="ent-lede">For startups of 2 to 300 people that are funded or earning revenue.</p>
        <ul class="ent-points" role="list">
          <li><b>90-day pilot,</b> no monthly fee</li>
          {% if pilot.open %}<li><b>No setup fee</b> for the first {{ pilot.spots }} design partners{% if pilot.showCount %} ({{ pilot.left }} of {{ pilot.spots }} left){% endif %}</li>{% else %}<li><b>{{ pilot.setupFee }} setup, once,</b> credited back if you stay</li>{% endif %}
          <li><b>At day 90,</b> lock today’s price for two years, or walk away</li>
          <li><b>In return,</b> you help us shape it</li>
        </ul>
        {#- The details live in the PDF (founder, 2026-11-24: the section read as
            too long): the agents, how the pilot runs, what you get, what we
            ask, the guardrails, the costs and who is behind it. Its source is
            src/_data/partnerProgram.js; `npm run pdf:partners` renders it. -#}
        <div class="ent-actions">
          <a class="ent-btn ent-btn--light" href="/enterprise/openshore-design-partner-program.pdf?v={{ rev.entPartnerPdf }}" download="OpenShore Design Partner Program.pdf">Download the full program <span class="ent-btn-meta">PDF</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="ent-lede ent-partner-ask">To apply, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.enterpriseContact }}?subject={{ 'OpenShore design partner' | urlencode }}">{{ site.enterpriseContact }}</a>. Jack reads every message and replies personally.</p>
      </section>
